\pard\fs24\lang2057\f1\fs27\cf1\b\ltrpar\ql\sb450\sa45\li150\ri45 Q1.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb0\sa0\li567\ri567 Scientists have used lasers to start a nuclear \b fusion\b0  reaction.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li567\ri567 The scientists used the lasers to heat a small amount of an isotope of hydrogen.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (a)\u8195?\~Describe what is meant by \u8216?isotopes\u8217? of an element.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0\fi0 (2)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (b)\u8195?\~Explain how nuclear \b fusion\b0  releases energy.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0\fi0 (3)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (c)\u8195?\~The fusion reaction releases large amounts of energy.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 The fusion reaction takes place in a reactor.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 Explain why the walls of the reactor should be made from a material with a very high specific heat capacity.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (2)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (d)\u8195?\~Nuclear fusion is safer than nuclear fission.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 Nuclear \b fission\b0  can lead to an uncontrolled chain reaction.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 Give \b one\b0  consequence of an uncontrolled chain reaction.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (1)\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0 (Total 8 marks)\par
\f1\fs27\cf1\ltrpar\ql\sb450\sa45\li150\ri45 Q2.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb0\sa0\li567\ri567 The process of nuclear fission is used in nuclear power stations.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li567\ri567 The figure below shows the process of nuclear fission.\par
\qc\sb240\sa0\li0\ri0{\pict\jpegblip\picw3465\pich2805\picwgoal3465\pichgoal2805\picscalex100\picscaley100
}\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (a)\u8195?\~Complete the sentences.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 Choose answers from the box.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb0\sa0\li0\ri0 \~\par

