\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 In nuclear power stations, energy is released from uranium\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 ______________________________ .\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb360\sa0\li1134\ri567 The uranium in above figure splits into two parts and releases three\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 ______________________________ .\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb360\sa0\li1134\ri567 The process of nuclear fission releases electromagnetic radiation in the form of\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 ______________________________.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (3)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li567\ri567 Use the Physics Equations Sheet to answer parts (a) and (b).\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (b)\u8195?\~Write down the equation which links energy (\i E\i0 ), power (\i P\i0 ) and time (\i t\i0 ).\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0\fi0 (1)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (c)\u8195?\~A nuclear power station has a power output of 500 MW.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 Calculate the energy output in 3600 s.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 Give your answer in J.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (3)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (d)\u8195?\~Radioactive waste produced by nuclear power stations has a long half-life.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 Suggest \b one\b0  precaution taken to reduce the hazard caused by radioactive waste from power stations.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (1)\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (e)\u8195?\~Nuclear power stations do \b not\b0  generate electricity every day of the year.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 One nuclear power station generated electricity for 92% of a year.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 one year = 365 days\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb360\sa0\li1134\ri567 Calculate the number of days during the year that the nuclear power station generated electricity.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (2)\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0 (Total 10 marks)\par
