\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 The models were tested before starting to build the first commercial nuclear fusion power station.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567 Suggest \b two\b0  reasons why models were tested.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (2)\par
