\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi0 Explain \b one\b0  environmental effect of generating electricity using fossil fuels.\par
\f1\fs20\cf0\b\ltrpar\qr\sb60\sa0\li0\ri0 (2)\par
