\f1\fs22\cf0\b0\ltrpar\ql\sb0\sa0\li1134\ri567\fi-567 (a)\~\~\~\~ Nuclear fission is used in nuclear power stations to generate electricity. Nuclear fusion happens naturally in stars.\par
\f1\fs22\cf0\ltrpar\ql\sb240\sa0\li1701\ri567\fi-567 (i)\~\~\~\~\~\~Explain briefly the difference between \i nuclear fission\i0  and \i nuclear fusion\i0 .\par
